### J6.6 — Request collection
### VS Code (REST Client / Humao extension), JetBrains Rider and Visual Studio 2022+ run this file directly.
### Start the app first, once per environment, and compare the answers:
###   dotnet run -- J6.6 --environment Development
###   dotnet run -- J6.6 --environment Production        (or just: dotnet run -- J6.6)
###   dotnet run -- J6.6 --environment Staging

@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1) Which environment is this, and how was it decided? (command line > DOTNET_ENVIRONMENT > ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT > default Production)
GET {{host}}/env

### 2) The broken endpoint, JSON client: Development leaks message + stack trace, Production returns a generic ProblemDetails + traceId
GET {{host}}/boom
Accept: application/json

### 3) The broken endpoint, browser-like client: Development returns the HTML developer exception page
GET {{host}}/boom
Accept: text/html

### 4) An unknown path: UseStatusCodePages + AddProblemDetails → ProblemDetails body for the empty 404
GET {{host}}/nothing

### 5) Development and Production side by side (starts two short-lived hosts on random ports, whatever the main host's environment is)
GET {{host}}/compare
